    <!--
        播放页（视频层）环色 = 与应用表面焦点环同值（近白）。

        用户报告（2026-10-11，dev1 实机）：「播放页存在多个不同颜色的高亮效果」——同一页里
        应用表面元素是近白环 #F5F7FF、视频层元素（分段/排序芯片、控制条、画面框）是灰蓝环
        #7695C5。深色表下这两类宿主的底色全部是深色（深色 surface、固定深靛玻璃、多数视频
        画面），近白环对它们都可读，所以深色表不需要为可读性保留第二种高亮色，统一取近白
        （与上游「默认选中边框是白色」的观感一致）。

        浅色表不能同值：浅色 FOCUS 深蓝 #0B57D0 画在固定玻璃上只有 1.83:1，必须保留派生
        夹取（见 values/webhtv_tokens.xml 与 ThemeResolver.PLAYER_RING_BACKDROPS）。

        已知取舍：近白环画在**纯白视频**上对比度不足（≈1.0:1）。该场景只在视频亮场景
        （雪/白墙）且焦点落在画面框或播控条上时出现，而深色表选近白正是用户明确要求的
        「默认选中边框是白色」；浅色表仍由夹取保证 ≥3:1。
    -->
    <color name="webhtv_color_player_focus_ring">#F5F7FF</color>
    <color name="webhtv_color_player_current_ring">#00A95A</color>
    <color name="webhtv_color_shadow">#000000</color>
    <!--
        深色表焦点环 = 近白（与上游的“白色焦点环”观感一致）。

        为什么不是纯 #FFFFFF：本仓库有 ThemeBinder 运行时改写通道，它按“颜色→语义角色”
        精确匹配；而 webhtv_on_wallpaper 两张表恒为 #FFFFFF。若焦点也取 #FFFFFF，
        ThemeColorIndex 会把 #FFFFFF 映射到 FOCUS 角色，用户切换/自定义主题时
        壁纸上的白色文字会被改写成焦点色（ThemeBaseWiringTest 钉住了这条不变量）。
        #F5F7FF 与纯白视觉上无法区分，对深色 surface 仍有 17.3:1。
    -->
    <color name="webhtv_color_focus">#F5F7FF</color>
    <color name="webhtv_color_player_control">#FFFFFF</color>
    <color name="webhtv_color_player_control_muted">#CCFFFFFF</color>
    <color name="webhtv_color_player_control_active">#FFD35C</color>
    <color name="webhtv_color_player_scrim">#8F000000</color>
    <color name="webhtv_color_health_good">#8EDB9F</color>
    <color name="webhtv_color_health_warn">#F2C66D</color>
    <color name="webhtv_color_health_bad">#FFB4AB</color>
    <color name="webhtv_color_overlay_light">#14FFFFFF</color>
    <color name="webhtv_color_overlay_dark">#66000000</color>
    <!-- 条目遮罩底色与文字色。遮罩与日间表同值（@color/black_40 = #66000000）：它压的
         底材是海报与封面，与页面调色板无关。文字色取本表 colorOnPrimary（深蓝 #062E6F），
         与日间表取更深的 onPrimary 同理。核算见 values/webhtv_tokens.xml 的同名条目。 -->
    <color name="webhtv_color_item_overlay">#66000000</color>
    <color name="webhtv_color_on_item_overlay">#062E6F</color>
    <!--
        Foreground for content drawn straight on the app wallpaper.

        One ?attr/colorOnSurface cannot serve both mobile consumers: every mobile
        activity paints a full-screen CustomWallView under its content and the built-in
        walls are dark, while dialogs draw their text on a light panel. Whichever table
        is compiled, one of the two loses: the light table left the settings rows
        near-black on the wallpaper, the dark table turned dialog text light on a light
        card. This role is the missing third value.

        It is 0xFFFFFFFF in both palettes because the wallpaper is always dark, so it
        needs no flavour or values-night override, and it matches the colour upstream
        painted these rows with (@color/white) so the default appearance is unchanged.

        The name deliberately avoids the webhtv_color_ prefix: ThemeTokens models the
        Material role contract and ThemeContractTest freezes that contract at exactly
        49 entries, so this is an extra non-role resource in the same family as
        webhtv_on_surface_20/70/80/90 in each palette.

        ThemeBinder leaves it alone. The baseline palette assigns 0xFFFFFFFF to several
        unrelated roles (onPrimary, onError, onSuccess, onWarning), whose active values
        never agree, so ThemeColorIndex sees the value as shared and skips the rewrite.
        ThemeBaseWiringTest freezes that property.
    -->
    <color name="webhtv_on_wallpaper">#FFFFFF</color>
    <!--
        壁纸上的次级前景，与日间表同值：壁纸本身两张表里都是深色，所以这一角色不需要
        随明暗切换。派生依据与对比度核算见 values/webhtv_tokens.xml 的同名条目。
    -->
    <color name="webhtv_on_wallpaper_variant">#CCFFFFFF</color>
    <!--
        卡片角标底色，与日间表同值：角标画在海报上，与页面调色板无关，因此不需要随明暗切换。
